  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "xu-zhimo-poems-s0024-p00024",
      "source_en": "I give you an image of Leifeng Pagoda, / a sky filled with dense dark clouds and white clouds. I give you the top of Leifeng Pagoda, / where moonlight flows down into the wakeful heart of the sleeping waves. Dense, deep night, lingering tower shadows, Round, dense moonlight, fine rippling gleam upon the water— If you and I were to row a small open skiff, if you and I were to make a complete dream! Written on September 26, 1923.",
